flowchart TD
    A[Landing page] --> B[Register / Login]
    B --> C[Onboarding: role, seniority, language]
    C --> D{Resume available?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Upload resume]
    D -- No --> F[Create profile manually]
    E --> G[Parse and review extracted facts]
    F --> H[Confirm candidate profile]
    G --> H
    H --> I{Job description available?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Paste or upload job description]
    I -- No --> K[Choose role template]
    J --> L[Requirement and skill-gap analysis]
    K --> M[Create preparation plan]
    L --> M
    M --> N[Configure mock interview]
    N --> O[Text or voice interview]
    O --> P[Adaptive questions and follow-ups]
    P --> Q[Answer evaluation and feedback]
    Q --> R[Session report]
    R --> S[Dashboard: trends and weak skills]
    S --> T[Targeted drill / resume improvement]
    T --> O
    style A fill:#0f172a,color:#fff
    style O fill:#2563eb,color:#fff
    style Q fill:#7c3aed,color:#fff
    style S fill:#059669,color:#fff